window.products.push({"id":673061,"name":"Dealight Waiters Corkscrew - Premium Rosewood All-in-one Corkscrew, Bottle Opener and Foil Cutter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51IVzl6QbbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Waiters Corkscrew Material: Stainless Steel +Wood Features:  1) Ergonomic design, easy to hold & use 2) High quality stainless steel with glass surface blade & unique wood pattern 3) Premium All-in-one Corkscrew, Bottle Opener and Foil Cutter 4) Double-hinged fulcrum for extra leverage and smoother pulling 5) Not for Minores  Usage 1) Open the build-in serrated foil cutter  2) Hold the wine bottle securely and remove any foil wrapped around the neck of the bottle 3) Open the corkscrew up by raising the arms straight up, which will expose the corkscrew spiral.  4) Keep the arms up on the opener and use stage pulling hinge neeganism to fix the wine bottle , securely insert the tip of the corkscrew spiral into the center of the cork.  5) Continue to hold the bottle securely, twist the corkscrew down into the cork using the lever at the top of the opener.  6) Be careful not to tip the bottle over, bring both arms of the opener slowly and firmly down. Successfully to pull out the corkscrew together with cork.   Package Included:  1 x Perfect Rosewood Wine Opener 1 x beautiful Gift Box  Looking for that perfect gift for someone special?  Dealight Waiters Rosewood Corkscrew Boasts a unique, black enchanting gift packaging that is sure to delight your loved one. With its Stark Black Box , This corkscrew surely sets wine standards to greater heights.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51IVzl6QbbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dealight","source_asin":"B00WY64VDK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-673061","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00WY64VDK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00WY64VDK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
