window.products.push({"id":673111,"name":"Chef Harvey Spiral Slicer, Stainless Steel Blade, For Easy Spiral Garnishes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6180w1mA-tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Chef Harvey’s Spiral Slicer easily creates long, decorative spiral-sliced garnishes that are uniform in size and shape for visually artful dishes. Beautiful foods and decorative drinks add a special wow factor that catches the eye and entices the appetite. Quickly transform everyday food into a work of art. Chef Harvey’s Spiral Slicer makes garnishing easy for an awe-inspired food presentation, like that used on cruise ships and in Japanese restaurants! The sharp blade cuts twin long, spiral ribbons from firm vegetables and fruits. A helpful addition to kitchen utensils and party supplies for effortless entertaining, easily create artful appetizers and decorative garnishes for an easy indoor and outdoor lifestyle. Create apple and vegetable chips, carrot curls, daikon radish clouds, cucumber and pepper garnish, finish craft cocktails with decorative spirals of lemon, lime, apple, or pineapple, make potato or carrot tornado skewers to grill for endlessly crispy and flavorful edges! Ideal for making festive party food, fun curly fries or butterfly fries, cucumber and carrot curls, kid’s snacks, salad toppers, fruit decorations, vegetable art, and more. Impress friends and family with a beautiful, bountiful brunch table. Super easy to use. For best results, cut larger produce into a cylindrical shape, twice the width of the blade. Press the pointed end into the center, or core, of the food. Insert finger into the handle and turn clockwise to slice. Continue until the item is fully sliced. For decorative grooved edges, drag a fork or multi-blade garnishing tool down along the outside surface before spiral slicing. Easily form spirals into circles by attaching the ends together with toothpicks. Compact for easy storage. This fruit and vegetable carving tool from Chef Harvey is made with a stainless steel blade. It’s comfortable and easy to use. Hand wash in warm, soapy water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6180w1mA-tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chef Harvey","source_asin":"B00T3K0DVE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-673111","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00T3K0DVE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00T3K0DVE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":673112,"name":"Milk Frother, Automatic Milk Steamer with New Foam Density Feature, Electric Frother with Hot or Cold Milk Function for Coffee, Cappuccino and Breakfa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51D+sEBjjML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"☕【GET YOU THE MOST SOFT & CREAMY MILK FOAM IN SECONDS】: Design for every foamy milk and coffee lover. Automatic Milk Frother heats up milk to approx 140 Fahrenheit and offers you the barista-level foam in 60-120 seconds,rich, soft and creamy froth for your favorite coffee beverage, Latte, Cappuccino, Hot Chocolate and so on. Recommend to use whole milk (Fat content>3 %) for better result.Enjoying Café quality at home right now. ☕【FROTH AND HEAT MILK IN ONE MACHINE】: There are three modes to meet your need. Just simply push a single button to get warm milk(up to approx 140 Fahrenheit), hot foam or cold foam in one frothier. You will make perfect froth to fit your lattes, cappuccinos, macchiatos and espresso at home. What’s more, this electric milk frother features a jug spout, which makes it easier to pour the milk out smoothly rather than splashing it all into your cup. Just what you need. ☕【EASY TO CLEAN AND USER FRIENDLY】: Non-Stick interior and FREE provided brush make your life easier. This milk frother comes with two different whisks ,milk frothing whisk and milk heating whisk. If you only want to heat up the milk, just install the milk heating whisk and press the HEAT button to start milk heating (Max 10.25 oz/300ml).el and this stainless steel nespresso milk frother is so on trend. It comes with fashion naturally, can fit everywhere. ☕【SILENT, STYLISH AND SAFE】: No sound at all when it’s working. The modern stylish design makes this milk frother to be the perfect modern appliance in your kitchen.We are 100% focus on the product safety. Food-grade materials are certified safe. Be equipped with Strix Temperature Controller and shut off automatically when your milk or froth is ready.ould wipe with a soft wet cloth. ☕☕☕☕☕【Customer Service】: Designed in US and produced by top manufacturer with stable and reliable quality. We provide our customer 12-MONTY WARRANTY. Please feel free to contact us if you have any quries.We will get back to you within 24 hours!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51D+sEBjjML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHINYA","source_asin":"B08LZ9CWR8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-673112","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LZ9CWR8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LZ9CWR8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
