window.products.push({"id":673130,"name":"EPLST Set of 4 Pillow Covers Decorative Throw Pillow Covers Vintage Wood Moose Deer Elk Bear Farmhouse Home Decor Cotton Linen Pillow Case Cushion Cov","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iU+dcaaUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Autumn is coming, so don't forget to take advantage of the season's harvest and hopeful inspiration indoors. Get a head start for the holiday season with our new style Thanksgiving Pumpkin and Autumn-themed pillow covers. What a wonderful way to spruce up your home! These pillow covers would make excellent presents as well. Advantage of EPLST Pillow Covers: √Safe to Machine Wash: easy to clean, long washed and does not fade. √Hidden Zipper Design: the stitching is tight, close and opens is smoothly and good looking! √Nice Moisture-absorption: the linen fabric offer comfortable cool touch in spring and warm touch in winter. √Perfect Decoration : suitable for indoor (sofa, couch, chair, living room, bedroom, home, office, etc) /outdoor (coffee shop, car, etc). Vintage pumpkin truck, maple leave, fruit and grain；Autumn background harvesting perfect combination, showing a strong Thanksgiving atmosphere, for you to add a beautiful touch. √Best Gift : to your friends, family and yourself, bring more surprise and joys. How to Create a Plump Pillow? Step 1: Open up the package and unzip the cover. Then when you stuff your pillow into the cover, you need to fold the insert. Step 2: After part of your folded pillow is stuffed in the cover, you should put the left part of the pillow slowly to reduce the risk of zipper split. Step 3: Then you can tide up the corner of the pillow, finally, you zip up the cover. Washing Tips: 1. Machine Wash Cold Separately or 30℃;  2. Gently Cycle Only or by hand; 3. No Bleach; 4. Tumble Dry Low; 5. Do Not Iron, Low Temperature If Necessary! Kindly Remind: - Pillow insert or filler are not included. - Due to hand made measuring and sewing, there might be a 0.4-0.7 inch size difference, hope you kindly understand. Package Included: 4 x Throw Pillow Covers -- Size: 18*18 inches/(45*45 cm)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iU+dcaaUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EPLST","source_asin":"B08Q87N1VG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-673130","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Q87N1VG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Q87N1VG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
