window.products.push({"id":673326,"name":"Humidifiers for Large Room Bedroom Home, 1.98 Gallon 7.5L Cool Mist Top Fill Filterless Air Humidifier for Baby Plants Whole House, Ultrasonic Humidif","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714NyOEffPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍀【Larger Tank, Longer Lasting】With 1.98 gallon water tank for large room, the air humidifier sends out fine mist for 83 hours on a single fill! You can enjoy whole night sleep, frees you from constant refill. The large humidifier covers space up to 624 FT². Perfect for bedroom, baby nurseries, living room, plants and pets. 🍀【Top Fill & No Leakage】Tailulu humidifiers for bedroom feature convenient top-fill design and 8.2 inches wide opening for quick refills and easy cleaning. Adopt reliable construction of one-piece water tank, ensuring the plant humidifier water tight and durable use for ages. No worry about damaging your furniture or floor anymore. 🍀【3 Mist Modes】The humidifiers for home offer 3 mist levels and 360° nozzle, quickly adjust the mist output and flow direction as your needs. Balance the humidity in your home all year long for relief from congestion, coughs, cold symptoms, allergies, dry skin and sinus issues. 🍀【Encourage Better Sleep】Customize timer for 2/4/8 hours before going to bed to make sleep more comfortable. With optional soft night light and running at only 28 dB, the humidifiers for baby get your little ones enjoy every breath and sink into a sweet dreamland quickly. 🍀【More Safety, Less Cost】BPA-free ensure your baby, kids and pets are in good health. When it runs out of water, the room humidifier will auto shut off, avoid any accidents at home for peace of mind. Besides, this humidifier is no filter needed, save you extra time and cost.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714NyOEffPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tailulu","source_asin":"B0BV5WDTR6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-673326","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BV5WDTR6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BV5WDTR6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
