window.products.push({"id":673330,"name":"Mueller HealthyBites Eco Nonstick 20 Inch Electric Griddle Teflon-free, 10 Eggs at Once, Cool-Touch Handles and Slide-Out Drip Tray, for Breakfast Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pc3SzUBgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Electric griddle: This awesome griddle has a 1500 watt heating system, cool-touch base with a built in slide-out drip tray. It’s removable probe enables precise temperature control for preparing steak, lamb chops, eggs, bread, vegetables, skewers, mushrooms, salmon, shrimp and anything your heart desires! Everything you need for a perfect breakfast, lunch or dinner, rain or shine! Premium Non-stick Cooking Surface – An easy removal makes adjusting the plate a piece of cake for your cooking needs. Because the Griddle features a non-stick cooking surface, food may be prepared with little or no oil. Meat or fish, it doesn’t stick and the Oil Drip Tray catches all the grease from cooking. Perfect for a low-fat diet! Smart Adjustable Temperature Control – Allows cooking at 5 different temperature settings, up to 430°F. A Breeze To Clean – The smooth non-stick cooking plate makes cleaning effortless, and in most cases a simple wipe over with a sponge and dish soap is all it needs! The temperature probe and drip tray are removable so you can easily maneuver while cleaning. Superior Quality With Mueller - We are here to offer you only the best quality products designed to make your life easier. If you need any help, please feel free to contact us. Our unparalleled 24/7 live telephone customer support is ready and waiting to assist with anything you need!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pc3SzUBgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MUELLER HOME","source_asin":"B0BWSHYSXN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-673330","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWSHYSXN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWSHYSXN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":673331,"name":"AddAcc 20000mAh Battery Operated Fan, Portable Camping Fan with Light and Hook, Rechargeable Desk Fan, 270° Pivot 4 Speeds Battery Powered Outdoor Fan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UVp6UsrIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"20000mAh Rechargeable Battery and Dual Ports: the rechargeable camping fan runs continuously for 58hours at low speed once fully charged, so you never have to worry about battery running out during camping, trip, hurricane, emergency power outage... the cordless fan with 2 usb ports to charge gadgets like mobile phone, camera and any camping accessories that needs juice via the USB C port or the USB-A port 4 Speeds for Choice: we are the 1st one to employ double layers of blades to a battery operated fan, this advanced tech helps the turbo to drive more air in a faster way and make you more comfortable in burning hot day, the lowest speed will meet most purposes, let alone it has 4 speeds, this USB camping fan is a great companion for both outdoor and indoors in every season 16 LED Beads with 3 Brightness: the portable battery powered fan with 4 bright led beads on every corner make it versa-tiles, the brightest setting helps you focus on your job during darkness/night, the second setting can illuminate a camper tent or a small space, the 1st setting can work as night light during your sleep,it also can be use as a jobsite fan, industrial fans and ventilador fan User Friendly: fan and Light are under control in separate button of this wireless fan, 4 LED INDICATORS to show the fan speed and another 4 LED INDICATORS to show the remaining battery, what makes us most proud is the SLEEP MODE Button, it turns off all the indicators and still give you coolness if you don't want any light during your sleep Portable and Convenient: this tent fan has a foldout hook, you can hang it on tent, branches or inside a car... to blow breeze from top like a ceiling fan; it's sturdy built with stable base, you can stand it as floor fan or table/desk fan, the fan head pivots 270 degree to circulate air from desired angle; USB C cable included, Adapter NOT, for fast charging, please use 5V/3A adapter","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UVp6UsrIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AddAcc","source_asin":"B0BHNZRH3W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-673331","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHNZRH3W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHNZRH3W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":673332,"name":"Homer Alaska Collage Professionally Framed Art Print from Travel Artwork by Artist Paul A. Lanquist Framed Art Size: 14\" x 20\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81s2ics0SqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This work of art was designed by Artist Paul A. Lanquist (PAL), a Pacific Northwest artist who currently lives in central Oregon. Through the years, PAL has gravitated to the work of illustrators from the 20's, 30's, and 40's that use color and design to communicate their ideas in a straightforward way. By combining the nostalgic look and feel of the past with the spectacular scenery of this country, PAL has created destination and travel posters that capture the beauty and life style of these unique areas. This professionally framed giclee art print is from an original work of art. All framed prints are professionally printed, mounted, framed, and finished in the United States. First, the art is printed on the highest-quality archival art paper using premium, long-lasting pigment-based art inks that generate intense, rich colors that are true to the artist's vision and original creation. Next, it is mounted and secured to prevent slipping, crumpling, or moving around. Then it is framed with a quality picture frame, expertly finished with art-quality clear acrylic, and fitted with a protective backing that includes hanging wires for an easy to hang piece of art. The time, care, and professionalism put into producing your wall art will make it a tremendous addition to your kitchen, bedroom, family room, office, cabin, or even dorm room.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81s2ics0SqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Art of Place","source_asin":"B01MRCI1HN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-673332","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MRCI1HN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MRCI1HN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
