window.products.push({"id":673434,"name":"Nick & Norma's Snap On Strainer For Pots - Pasta Strainer - Pot Strainer - Universal Clip On Strainer For Pasta - Clip On Pasta Strainer - Silicone Pa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JoAyZKYrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stop Transferring Hot Pasta From Pot To Strainer! Classic Strainers Will Go Extinct Once You Purchase You Nick & Norma’s Clip-on Strainer. Fits Almost Any Pot, Pan, Bowl Or Round Containers. To Attach Pot Strainer, Simply Clip To Side Of Your Pot, Pan Or Bowl And You Are Ready To Strain Your Fruits, Vegetables, Meat, And Pasta. Specification: Material: Silicone + Stainless Steel Size: 9 * 3 * 2.2 Inches Suggested Temperature Range: -40° ~ 230° Package Includes: 1 Silicon Food Strainer Durable Kitchenware Made From Top-quality Silicone And Stainless Steel, The Food Strainer Has The Durability To Last For Many Years. Designed To Help Remove Excess Water While Avoiding Transferring The Food Out Of The Pot. Universal Clip-on Design The Clip's Firm Grip Will Keep It Safely Attached While In Use. This Design Enable You To Grip The Pot Or Pan With Both Hands While Straining, Eliminating Spills. Simply Snap On The Pot Or Bowl And Stabilize The Pot With Both Hands, Then Strain Foods. Fits All Round Cookware Flexible, Pot Strainer Will Fit All Types Of Cookware And Sizes, Such As, Pots, Pans, And Bowls. It Snaps On With Two Clips. For Straining And Pouring Of Water And Juices From Spaghetti Pasta, Ground Beef Grease, Vegetables, Potatoes, Tomatoes And Other Foods. Faqs Will This Work With A Thin Pasta Like Angel Hair? Yes. Small Hole Design Allows For Straining Without Spilling Any Pasta. Is It Dishwasher-safe? Yes. Hand Wash Is Recommended; However, You Can Wash It Using A Dishwasher. Will It Scratch A Non-stick Surface? No. Silicone Wrapped Clips Won’t Cause Any Damage To Your Non-stick Cookware.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JoAyZKYrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nick and Norma's","source_asin":"B09XLNTGPF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-673434","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XLNTGPF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XLNTGPF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
