window.products.push({"id":673460,"name":"TOPDEEP 12 Pieces 24\"x 16\" Artificial Boxwood Panel, Grass Wall Panel, Boxwood Hedge Wall Panels UV Protected Suitable for Artificial Green Wall Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":68.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91bSrsziVEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DURABLE & RELIABLE -- Artificial Boxwood Hedge Panels are made of high-density polyethylene,well-made and show a realistic look. Durability and lightweight, UV-proof, weather-resistant, low-maintenance, soft to the touch. They will not fade, even under harsh outdoor conditions. No maintenance, trimming, or upkeep, the boxwood backdrop wall will keep its fresh appearance year round . THICK ARTIFICIAL HEDGE -- Comes with 12 pieces 24\"x16\" faux boxwood panels(covers about 31sq ft), Zip Ties(100PCS) ,4 x Artificial Flowers, and Installation Guide. Lifetime free accessory replacements and Three Limited Years for boxwood panels.Realistic Appearance through leaves that are taller(1.6-2 INCH) and 4 layered. While Denser Panels(400 stitches per tile panel) offer better privacy Hedges and a natural appearance.It can be hung on the fence of the garden to avoid privacy leakage. EASY TO INSTALL -- Just attach the panel with the included pin and hole lock , you will get a large rectangle or square as you wish. Each panel has an interlocking connector for easy installation, Simply follow the manual to guide you through the process. Or you may cut the mesh to a suitable shape or size for DIY before assembling. The back of each panel consists of 22 * 14 grids that can be cut to the desired size and shape using scissors,fit and shape to any space. INDOOR and OUTDOOR DECORATION -- Indoor decorative applications for greenery wall background, and other places like balcony, living room, office work area, holiday party event and more; Outdoor applications for a patio privacy screen, use in porch, fencing, yard, walkways, drywalls, trellises, wedding photography backgrounds,etc. SGS Certification -- Our Artificial Grass Wall Panels are SGS certified and meet stringent safety standards of CPSIA and ROHS related terms.Greenery panels are made of new PE for durability and sun protection, and are tested and certified for light aging under sun exposure. 5-8 year outdoor and 15 year indoor expected life. We provide free warranty, you can contact seller customer service at any time, all message will be replied in 12 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91bSrsziVEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Topdeep","source_asin":"B0BN7F3N18","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-673460","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN7F3N18","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN7F3N18","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
