window.products.push({"id":673527,"name":"Administrative Assistant Coffee Mug 15 oz white. Being An Administrative Assistant Is Easy Like Riding A Bike Except The Bike Is On Fire You're On Fir","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LPXZ7WtwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Best Quality and Originality: Buy an awesome Administrative Assistant coffee mug for a family member, a friend, a colleague or yourself! The unique and funny coffee or tea cup is a great way to spread love, joy, happiness and laughter to the special ones in your life. Creative gifts are liked by all and are the best way to uplift your mood. We design and produce our brand exclusively to meet our high standards of quality and originality and satisfy our clients. Product information: All 15 oz ceramic mugs feature printing on both sides that is guaranteed to last for years. Our coffee cups are dishwasher and microwave safe and are great for home and restaurant use. The mugs are made of 100% pure white ceramic and have a large easy grip handle. All of our ceramic mugs are printed in the USA. 100% total and complete satisfaction guaranteed! Unique and funny: One thing that can make your day is a good laugh with an old friend while drinking from a funny coffee mug. Another is a relaxing moment shared with the aroma from a warm cup of coffee or tea with a unique message that will cheer you up and motivate you during the whole day. This unique Administrative Assistant mug is a great idea to make people remember you with every sip they take Classy: By holding a stylish coffee mug in your hand, you make a classy statement in a silent way. Get the unique custom coffee cups with unforgettable title Being An Administrative Assistant Is Easy Like Riding A Bike Except The Bike Is On Fire You're On Fire And In Hell , add to your collection and impress people with your amazing style. Memorable gift: Our Unique and Funny coffee mugs are intended for coffee lovers and for all who enjoy a perfect coffee cup. When you buy our personalized coffee mug for someone, they will remember you every morning with a warm smile on their face. Design:BC490","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LPXZ7WtwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Exquisite Mugs","source_asin":"B07P7C85XG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-673527","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P7C85XG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P7C85XG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
