window.products.push({"id":673562,"name":"Nidouillet L Shaped Desk, 50.8\" Corner Computer Desk, Modern Home Office Desk with Large Monitor Shelf and CPU Stand, Writing Workstation, Gaming Desk","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610actwt9wL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"With SWITCHABLE MONITOR SHELF & CPU STAND : Our L shape desk with a dismountable monitor shelf leaves plenty of surface space for your keyboard and mouse when gaming, writing, computer work, and other home office activities. It can be installed on either left or right side to fit different work habit(reversible). And the free CPU stand can be installed on any place of desktop. It makes the most of your space. SPACIOUS WORK AREA : The computer desk's dimensions are 50.8”(L) x 50.8\"(L) x 18.1\"(D) x 29.1\"(H). It provides enough space to keep multiple computers, laptops, books, pencil vase and so on. Ample bottom space allows you to rest your legs and do some stretches after a long time work or anytime you feel tired. You can also form the U shaped workstation by getting 2 computer desk together. EASY TO ASSEMBLE AND CLEAN : Made of the textured surface, the well-design desk is anti-skidding, anti-scratch, and easy cleaning. To make assembling this sturdy L-shaped computer desk as effortless as possible, we have included quite clear and detailed instructions, numbered parts, and all necessary tools in the package. And we also provided installation video in our product listing. STURDY CONSTRUCTION AND ADJUSTABLE LEVELING STUDS : The corner computer desk is constructed by superior P2 MDF Board and metal frame. The desk frame is made of heavy-duty powder-coated steel which ensures stability and durability, 1.57\" by 0.59\" bar width strong enough to support heavy duty parcels. Adjustable leveling studs are provided to keep the computer desk stable even on an uneven floor. MODERN L SHAPE DESIGN : Enlarge your storage space horizontally and vertically in your working or gaming room with this home office desk with shelves. L Shape design easy to fit snugly in a corner to maximize your limited space. Keep your working, writing, studying or gaming area neat, tidy and organized. The sophisticated design make it suitable for office home and other spaces.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610actwt9wL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nidouillet","source_asin":"B08NCVP2KP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-673562","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NCVP2KP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NCVP2KP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
