window.products.push({"id":673649,"name":"Air Wick Candles Ribbons, Vanilla and Soft Velvet, 6.35-Ounce (Pack of 2)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.48,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91DX5h+cUAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description New Air Wick scented candles are available in seven exclusive fragrances that fragrance any room up to 40 hours. Amazon.com AIR WICK Candles Ribbons Vanilla & Soft Velvet contain ribbons of essential oils to fill your home with a luxurious scent. The warm scent of sweet vanilla with velvety spice notes creates ambiance and makes your home feel warm and inviting. This candle has a 30-hour burn time and is enclosed in a modern square glass votive that lends a decorative touch to any room in your home. Candles RibbonsVanilla & Soft Velvet At a Glance: Ribbons of essential oils provide powerful fragrance Ribbons of essential oils provide powerful fragrance 30-hour burn time 30-hour burn time Refreshes your home and creates instant atmosphere Refreshes your home and creates instant atmosphere Decorative square glass container Decorative square glass container Welcoming scent of vanilla, spices, and velvety cream Welcoming scent of vanilla, spices, and velvety cream Create a rich ambiance with this candle's inviting fragrance and 30-hour burn time. View larger . Ribbons of Essential Oils Release Powerful Fragrance AIR WICK Candles are an easy way to instantly lift your spirits and make your house feel cozy and welcoming. As the candle burns, ribbons of essential oils emit a rich, lingering fragrance. Sets a Cozy Mood This scented candle is great for setting a mood while entertaining. Place a few on the mantle or table for atmosphere. Its steady glow lends warmth and comfort, inviting guests to relax. Refresh Your Home The AIR WICK Candle helps refresh stale air and mask everyday odors in your home. It offers an easy and effective way to sweeten your surroundings with the warm scent of sweet vanilla with velvety cream and spice notes. Decorative Square Glass Votive This AIR WICK Candle comes in a reusable modern square glass votive that complements a range of decor. About AIR WICK Developed in 1943, AIR WICK was one of the first odor eliminators and left homes across America smelling clean and fresh. Today, AIR WICK products are available in a variety of formats and fragrances, from robust automatic sprays to indulgent candles, so you can ensure your home always smells fresh and inviting and creates just the right atmosphere to enhance your mood. What's in the Box AIR WICK Candles Ribbons Vanilla & Soft Velvet votive (6.35 ounces). Air Wick CandlesCool LinenWhite LilacFreshWatersIslandParadiseLavender andChamomileApple CinnamonMedleyCrisp Linen andWhite LilacLavender andChamomileVanilla IndulgenceApples &Sheer CinnamonVanilla &Soft VelvetWhite Berries &Cool Silk Trademark Information: AIR WICK®","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91DX5h+cUAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Air Wick","source_asin":"B0056YFTH4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-673649","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0056YFTH4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0056YFTH4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
