window.products.push({"id":673742,"name":"Luvan 304 Stainless Steel Mixing Bowls with Airtight Lids(Set of 6), Nesting Bowls for Stackable, 3 Grater Attachments & Non-slip Silicone Bottom, for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dUy0fAVYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High-quality 304 Stainless Steel】The mixing bowls set is made of premium stainless steel which constructed ofmirror-finish interior and matte-finish exterior. These bowls are designed to resist dents and rustproof, as well as odor, stain and taste resistant.The bowls of deep construction for generous servings can satisfy your demands whether you are cooking, baking or simply storing food. 【Airtight Seal】The BPA-free airtight lids fit snugly over these bowls to maintain a seal that keeps food fresh and dry. With an airtight lid, you can also store food or leftovers overnight in the refrigerator or freezer. The extra largest sealing cover with a removable center where the grater attachment can be placed.This small opening can also be used to place the hand blender, which can effectively prevent the liquid from splashing around during the whipping process. 【Grater Attachments】The bowls set also comes with 3 different grater inserts (slicing/grating/shredding), which can be placed on the extra black airtight lid to make it easier to handle ingredients and prepare food. 【Silicone Bottom】The silicone non-slip bottom provides a good grip and secures the stainless steel bowl to the countertop while mixing, preventing it from moving around. It also will not scratch counters.You can easily mix all your favorite ingredients and foods without worrying about the bowl shaking as you mix, beat, or whisk. 【Nestable and Stackable】The size of the stainless steel bowls set is 1, 1.5, 1.9, 2.6, 3.4, 4.2 QT.With a perfect nesting design, these metal bowls stack easily, fit perfectly in your cabinets and save storage space to keep your kitchen clutter-free. These bowls are great for whisking eggs, mixing desserts, baking batter, cake dough, tossing salads, washing vegetables. They are easy to clean by hand and dishwasher safe. NOTE: Please hand wash the lids and grater attachments to avoid deformation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dUy0fAVYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Luvan","source_asin":"B071SFK96C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-673742","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071SFK96C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071SFK96C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
