window.products.push({"id":673795,"name":"xo, Fetti Wifey Wine Tumbler Gift | Pink + White 12oz Matte Stainless Steel, Bachelorette Party Decorations Cups + Bride Stemless Bridal Shower, Engag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hGOyv4SWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wife of the Party: To-go style. And this wife needs a refill, ASAP! Show off with this pretty as a picture pink + white “Wifey” tumbler - whether you take it to the pool, the beach, your backyard… Who cares?! You’ve got the cutest one around. Sun shining a little too hard? No worries. Our stainless steel Wifey cup promises to keep your bevvy cold even on the warmest of days. With a push-seal lid + drinking hole, there's not an event this tumbler isn't ready for! Fill it up again + again - this cup measures 4.5\" tall and is made of fully dishwasher-safe stainless steel! This pink + white Wifey tumbler is truly the ultimate bachelorette party decoration!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hGOyv4SWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"xo, Fetti","source_asin":"B082MPQ71Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-673795","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082MPQ71Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082MPQ71Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":673796,"name":"Mixpresso Aluminum Moka stove coffee maker, Moka Pot Coffee Maker for Gas or Electric Stove Top, Classic Italian Coffee Maker,Espresso Maker Stovetop,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51f2ljp4uyL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"CLASSIC ITALIAN ESPRESSO MAKER: We at Mixpresso bring you the perfect solution to enjoy your morning coffee; the ways to enjoy the espresso cup are many, and our classic Italian Moka pot, manual coffee percolator machine will give you that; all the coffee recipes, latte, cappuccino, traditional espresso and all that in 1use with our Moka Espresso Coffee Maker. CLASSIC DESIGN AND SAFTEY MOKA POT: We want to bring you the perfect and safe Moka coffe maker, Made of a stylish and durable aluminum body in an 8-sided octagon shape to diffuse heat and enhance the coffee aroma. as well the espresso maker pot also has a rubber handle with a finger grip for easy handling and secure grip. EASY TO USE WITH INSTRUCTIONS: For using the stovetop espresso maker, Unscrew the top and remove the filter funnel from the base. Fill the bottom with fresh water up to the level of the safety valve and insert the filter funnel. Fill the filter funnel with ground coffee (do not press down), and screw the top firmly to the base. 3-5 minutes on medium heat, you will get the result of rich and high-quality espresso coffee or Cafetera Cubana. COMPACT AND EASY TO CLEAN: This espresso maker is ideal for you, compact, and suitable for small surfaces without taking up space in your kitchen. The espresso pot is also really easy to clean with soap and water rinse (not safe in a dishwasher). GAS ELECTRIC OR INDUCTION STOVETOP: our versatile coffee maker is great for gas and electric stove tops. as well Can be used on induction cooktops. Take it with you anywhere - enjoy camping with your family or friend just as long as you have your heat source, water, and coffee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51f2ljp4uyL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mixpresso","source_asin":"B0BGYNDXPF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-673796","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGYNDXPF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGYNDXPF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
