window.products.push({"id":673860,"name":"Clingks 12 Drink Markers - I'M THANKFUL FOR - Fun Thanksgiving Wine Charm Alternative","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cBnnm7o6L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Clingks are the hippest trend in glassware…removable, reusable decals that cling to glasses, bottles, coffee mugs, even plastic! The sassy phrases will put your guests in the party spirit right from the start. Wine charms dangling off the stems are so yesterday. Modern wine glasses are stemless. Thanks to Mad Men, the classic cocktail party is making a big comeback. And highballs don’t have stems. So how do you keep track of your glass at a modern, hip party? We have just the thing…","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cBnnm7o6L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Clingks","source_asin":"B0147JJ1FY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-673860","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0147JJ1FY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0147JJ1FY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":673861,"name":"Brugo 16-Ounce Travel Mug, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41XbVC2uwqL._AC_.jpg","description":"More than just an insulated travel mug, the Brugo (aka, Brew-Go) enables you to sip your favorite hot beverage in the \"Perfect Temperature Zone\" while eliminating spills, spatters and burned lips that are the hallmarks of lesser travel mugs. Rather than having to wait until your coffee or tea cools down from its freshly brewed temperature of 205 degrees, the Brugo features innovative thermodynamic technology that allows you to enjoy your beverage at just the right drinking temperature. And it's simple to use--just tip and cool or sip. The Brugo travel mug in Midnight/Black. The Brugo features a 16-ounce capacity, ergonomic grip, no-slip bottom, and stylish stainless steel and chrome accents. The spill-resistant Brugo travel mug is great for both hot and cold drinks, and it features a 16-ounce capacity, ergonomic grip, no slip bottom, double wall insulation, and a stainless steel and chrome finish. This version comes in Midnight/Black, and the Brugo is available in a rainbow of other color options. The three-position selector on the Brugo's lid allows you complete control over how you enjoy your beverage. Brugo's Thermodynamic Technology The thermodynamic science behind the Brugo travel mug gives you the power to immediately enjoy the most vibrant flavor at the perfect drinking temperature. As we've all experienced at one time or another, freshly brewed coffee is just too hot to enjoy right away. And if you don't want to wait patiently for it to cool, you have very few options--blow on it, add ice or sip it very carefully while trying not to burn your mouth. The secret to enjoying your hot beverage at just the right temperature with the Brugo is its innovative temperature control chamber, which quickly brings each sip of your coffee or tea to the perfect temperature with a quick tip of the wrist. The best temperature for brewing coffee is a scalding 205 degrees (F), while the best temperature for drinking coffee is a comfortably hot 150 to 170 degrees. At this temperature range--the Perfect Temperature Zone (or, PTZ)-- your tastebuds sense the maximum flavor of your beverage. A regular cup of coffee, if you wait long enough, will eventually cool to the PTZ, but it will only stay in that zone for a short amount of time before it becomes too cool and acquires a bitter taste. If you remove the lid or add ice, you'll get to the PTZ sooner, but it will shorten your time in the zone even further. But with the Brugo, each individual sip of coffee is adjusted to the perfect temperature zone using the unique three-position selector on the lid. The Brugo travel mug features a main interior chamber that holds your hot beverage, which is surrounded by a cooling Temperature Control Chamber that allows about one sip of beverage to cool to your desired temperature. After setting the dial on the lid to Tip & Cool mode, tip the mug directly away from you and gently swish your beverage from side to side for about 2 seconds at about a 45-degree angle. This swishing motion will prepare one sip of beverage in the cooling chamber. And since you're only cooling each sip and not the entire drink, the remaining coffee stays hotter longer--resulting in maximum time in the PTZ. Additionally, the three-position selector has a Sip mode that allows you to bypass the Temperature Control Chamber and drink your beverage directly just like a traditional mug as well as a Lock position to keep the mug from spilling during travel. How to Get the Most from Your Brugo Travel Mug Tighten until guide marks are aligned Choose a setting by turning dial to Lock, Tip & Cool, or Sip. (Dial may feel tight. After 30 seconds, the beverage will warm the mechanism and it will turn easily.) How can I make sure I am using the mug correctly? Tighten the lid until the small hash marks on the front of the mug and the lid are aligned. In the Tip & Cool position, tip the mug directly away from you for 2 seconds at about a 45-degree angle and swirl the mug with a brandy motion. The Tip & Cool setting is designed to work best when the mug is completely full. Once the mug is 3⁄4 or less full, use the Sip setting. By this time the main beverage should have reached a palatable temperature. When filling your mug, remember that only the liquid in the main chamber is protected from spills. So when you use the lock setting, you'll need to first drink or pour out any liquid that may have already entered the cooling chamber. Once you do this, your beverage will be safe from all accidental spills and spatters. Is the Brugo mug dishwasher safe? We do not recommend that you use your Brugo mug in the dishwasher. If you must, use top shelf only.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41XbVC2uwqL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brugo","source_asin":"B000GDEZZC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-673861","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000GDEZZC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000GDEZZC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":673862,"name":"Aatm Rudraksha Seed with Golden Caping Bracelet for Healing, Meditation and Prayer (Beads Size - 7-8 mm)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718nr5d-1eL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"According to Shiv puran, Rudraksha beads were formed out of the teardrops of Shiva when he came out of a deep meditation. His tears when hit the ground, took the shape of seeds. Later, Rudraksha trees emerged from them. Rudraksha is the one that has the ability to wipe our tears and provide happiness. A five mukhi Rudraksha also gives a person Name, Fame and Mental Peace. A five Mukhi Rudraksha has got 5 natural lines (mukhas) on its surface.This is a most commonly found Rudraksha & it destroys the “Bad Karmas” of the present life, thereby making the wearer pure and his mind become peaceful and calm. This Rudraksha also protects a person from Accidental Deaths and it is also very important in any kind of Saadhna or Meditation. The beautiful clear white light of the white ray is your connection to the Divine Mind, and white is the color for the eighth chakra. Using Clear Quartz Crystals or White Crystal will assist the higher chakras to emanate white light and aids your connection with spirit. It brings clarity to your communication and will amplify your thoughts and may assist you by stimulating clearer thinking. It has a strong resonance, which is why it is commonly used by healers as part of crystal healing. It has a positive effect on all chakras as it protects the aura and expands the human energy field.Although this stone is usually thought of as one of the chakra stones for the higher chakras, it will aid all chakras.22 to 24 beads.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718nr5d-1eL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aatm","source_asin":"B0731PCV17","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-673862","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0731PCV17","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0731PCV17","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
