window.products.push({"id":673872,"name":"Qubitful Faux Pampas Grass, 9 PCS 37''/3.1FT Tall Fluffy Fake Pompas Floral, Large Artificial Pompous Grass Branches for Floor Vase Fillers, Boho Farm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mHAk3ubBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[🌾 Quantity & Size] The package includes 9 stems of large Ivory faux pampas grass. Our tall fake pompas grass is approx 3.1 feet, 37''/95cm. The feathers plume is about 23'' and the stem is 14''. [🌾 No Shedding and No Maintenance] Unlike dried pampas grass or natural reed, the silk faux pampas grass does not shed or smell, so you never have to worry about a mess! Artificial pompous grass looks lovely and lasts forever, allowing you to enjoy the benefit of no breaking and no maintenance whatever. [🌾 Tall and Fluffy] Our artificial pampas grass is fluffy, luxurious, and looks natural, fluttering in the wind to create that boho chic appearance. You can fill your vase with 9 stems or just part of the sets to complement your aesthetic home decor. [🌾 Material] The artificial pampas grass is made of high-quality silk, paper, and iron wire. Each stem is made with thin iron wire wrapped paper, so it can be bent easily to suit different style vases as you need. The real natural look of the fake reed will elevate the beauty in any room in your home or office. [🌾 Boho Room Decor] Our large fluffy pampas grass is not only natural but perfect for the chic bohemian farmhouse home decor. Show off your style and creativity with the unique pampas grass. Ideal flower arrangement for the living room, bedroom, kitchen, office, cafe, restaurant, and rustic farmhouse decor. [🎁 Perfect Gift Idea] The pampas grass is a wonderful gift for any family members and friends. It can be presented to your loved ones on Mother's Day, Valentine's Day, Christmas Day, Wedding, Anniversary, and other meaningful days. [❤️ Warm Tips] The faux pampas grass arrived in curved type for easy transportation.You can reshape the stem easily by bending iron wire after receiving the package. Please feel free to contact us, if you have any questions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mHAk3ubBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"QUBITFUL","source_asin":"B0B1D3X9SX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-673872","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1D3X9SX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1D3X9SX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
