window.products.push({"id":673969,"name":"Fastpeace Great Dane Dog Gifts, Mothers Day - Fathers Day - Birthday Gifts for Dog Lovers - Dog Mom - Dog Dad, Great Dane Funny Facts Tumbler Stainles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Pa4Cj6fIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERFECT GIFT: This steel dog tumbler comes to your mind as the first choice for parties, camping, wedding, home, office... Besides, these tumblers are perfect gifts for any event including Mother’s Day, Father’s Day, Christmas, Halloween, birthday… to your lovers, family, or friends MATERIAL: Each of our dog tumblers is custom-hand-made with SUS 304 body and premium material lid. Sleek and Lightweight- Made with 100% Stainless Steel. Gently fits into your hand with an Anti-Sweat design. The only drink lid that uses the power of magnets to keep your water, beer, or favorite drink on lock. A durable coat of color won’t fade, peel, or crack through extended field use and also provide additional grip. HIGH QUALITY: The double-wall insulated tumbler with a vacuum between helps your drink to keep its temperature from 6 to 24 hours. Any drink that is hot, like coffee, can stay hot for up to 6 hours. Cooler drinks, (i.e. lemonade), can stay cold for up to 24 hours. The high-quality stainless steel and the double-walled insulation design ensure beverage can stay either hot or cold over time. CAPACITY AND PACKAGE: You will receive a 1 x 20oz Stainless Steel Tumbler (no straw included). The lightweight and compact feel make it easy to fit into most car cup holders. Dimension of the tumbler: Top Diameter x Bottom Diameter x Height: 8.8 x 7.2 x 17.5 (cm). AFTER SALE SERVICE: To ensures customer satisfaction. If you’re not delighted with these cute tumblers, return them for a 100% refund of your purchase price. We aim high and will do everything we can to keep our customers happy. And our promise, like a family tree, is as solid as oak.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Pa4Cj6fIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fastpeace","source_asin":"B0B9RN7JSW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-673969","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9RN7JSW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9RN7JSW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
