window.products.push({"id":673980,"name":"4 Pack Large Capacity Clothes Storage Bag, 90L Foldable Blanket Storage Bags with Reinforced Handle, Sturdy Zipper, Double Clear Window, Clothing Stor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wHdny2ZRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Linen Printing Fabric Clothes Storage Bags 👉[Large Clothing Storage Bags] 90L clothing storage bags are spacious enough to hold 1 king-size comforter or 3 pillows in one bag. Fit nice and snug and still have room left over. Each blanket storage bags measures 23.6 x 16.9 x 13.7 in / 60 x 43 x 35 cm. The storage bags for clothes provides plenty of space for blanket storage, clothing storage, sheets storage, quilts storage, bedding storage, pillows storage, comforters storage, sweater storage, toys storage, baby clothes storage, etc. 👉[Upgraded Linen Printing Fabric] The comforter storage bag is made of high-quality odorless, waterproof linen printing fabric. Which makes it long-lasting, not like other low-quality non-woven fabrics. Our blanket storage bags are more durable than others clothes storage bags which are hard to be broken. At the same time, the storage containers for clothes will protect your stored items, you don’t need to worry about your comforters or bedding getting wet. 👉[Reinforced Handles] The blanket storage bags' handles are reinforced with two additional layers of thick fabric. The reinforced handle makes the clothes storage containers easy to carry and move around when you move or load heavy items. It is much durable than the ordinary clothing storage solution. 👉[Double Clear Window Design & Sturdy Zipper] The storage bags for clothes is equipped with two-way stainless steel #6 zippers which are strong than the #5 zipper used in other ordinary bedding storage products. It is easy to set items into clothing storage containers. The double window design in the front can be allowing you to quickly see what is stored inside the comforter storage bag. When to clean, simply wipe the clothing storage bags with a wet towel gently and air dry. 👉[Multifunctional & Foldable] The foldable clothing storage bags can be used for bedroom closet wardrobes, also for attic, apartment, basement, university dormitory, etc. By the way, it is also a good choice for storing seasonal clothes. The soft and strong material allows it to be folded when not in use to save space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wHdny2ZRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BESTFOREST","source_asin":"B09L82TYV1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-673980","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09L82TYV1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09L82TYV1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
